      "description": "## Goal\n\nOnce the upstream DataFn release is published, upgrade Skillplane to the latest compatible released DataFn packages and remove the local date-serialization workaround.\n\n## Dependency\n\nWait for upstream pending DataFn changes to merge and a release containing the relation-projection date fixes to be published. Upstream publishing is outside this issue. Do not remove the workaround before that release is available.\n\n## Context\n\nSkillplane currently uses @datafn/server 0.1.1. Its relation-projection omission logic can turn Date values into {}. Skillplane compensates with jsonSafeValue and createJsonSafeReadAdapter in packages/datafn/src/server.ts. Upstream dev contains date preservation (5e122f2ae6065dd1f8898031cbf615c265cf36bb) and nested-array omission handling (ff8338238608fe6af1bd898d0f428c205110405b).\n\n## Scope\n\n* Verify the published release contains the upstream fixes and review its compatibility requirements.\n* Bump the relevant DataFn catalog entries in pnpm-workspace.yaml and update pnpm-lock.yaml, keeping related packages compatible.\n* Remove jsonSafeValue/createJsonSafeReadAdapter and obsolete imports/comments; pass the database adapter directly to DataFn.\n* Retain the role-scoped domain model aliases introduced in PR [21nCo/skillplane#16](https://linear.app/21n/review/fix-datafn-model-mappings-in-regional-database-adapters-daae67384487); those fix Skillplane configuration and are not this workaround.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n* Skill detail/currentVersion and version-history dates serialize correctly without the wrapper, using both combined and regional adapters.\n* Existing tenant-isolation and mutation-denial coverage remains green; add focused regression coverage where needed for nested relation dates/arrays.\n* Relevant integration tests, type checks, lint and build pass.\n* Dev verification confirms skill detail, SKILL.md content and version history in India, US and EU.\n\nNo upstream DataFn/AuthFn implementation or publishing work is included.",
